00:28:46,620 --> 00:28:51,000
I know I was a bad student, but
I know I only caused you trouble.

521
00:28:52,260 --> 00:28:53,090
Hey!

522
00:28:53,173 --> 00:28:54,003
Did you guys hear?

523
00:28:54,086 --> 00:28:55,617
Big news from Scrap Heave Island!

524
00:28:55,700 --> 00:28:58,524
Did Tom's workers actually
finish the Sea Train?

525
00:28:59,620 --> 00:29:02,502
But all the same, thank
you for looking after me.

526
00:29:05,940 --> 00:29:09,058
You put together a fine team
of shipwrights, Iceberg.

527
00:29:09,660 --> 00:29:11,954
I'm sure they'll take good care of you.

528
00:29:12,560 --> 00:29:15,325
I'm sorry I've been such
a pain over the years.

529
00:29:17,480 --> 00:29:19,920
Granny Kokoro, Shorty and the Rabbit,

530
00:29:21,220 --> 00:29:22,050
Yokozuna,

531
00:29:23,140 --> 00:29:25,200
all the lively townspeople,

532
00:29:26,520 --> 00:29:27,920
my little sisters,

533
00:29:31,200 --> 00:29:35,560
Sodom, Gomorrah, and all my bros,

534
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:38,240
I love you guys so much.

535
00:30:01,200 --> 00:30:03,377
I'm gonna super miss

536
00:30:03,460 --> 00:30:10,440
you all put on some pants
